OL,3,AKenya moves to register frightened
OL,4,ABurundians as tension over foreign
OL,5,Atraders rises
OL,6,
OL,7,FKenya says it will register
OL,8,Fundocumented Burundians and other East
OL,9,FAfricans living in the country,
OL,10,Ffollowing days of anxiety over
OL,11,FPresident William Ruto's directive
OL,12,Ftargeting foreigners in small-scale
OL,13,Fbusinesses.
OL,15,FOn Monday, hundreds of Burundians
OL,16,Fscrambled to process travel documents
OL,17,Famid uncertainty over whether they
OL,18,Fcould remain in Kenya.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
