OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AKenya moves to register frightened
OL,4,ABurundians as tension over foreign
OL,5,Atraders rises
OL,6,
OL,7,FCharles Owino, the Kenyan government
OL,8,Fspokesperson, has now said those
OL,9,Fwithout proper documents should
OL,10,Fregister through their embassies or
OL,11,Fhigh commissions as the authorities
OL,12,Fwork with diplomatic missions to
OL,13,Fregularise their status.
OL,15,FThose undergoing registration would be
OL,16,Fpresumed legally in Kenya during the
OL,17,Fprocess, Owino said.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
